# --- Local RF data: NEVER commit -------------------------------------------
# Baselines, event databases and IQ captures describe the radio environment
# of the place they were recorded: neighbouring Wi-Fi networks, when people
# are home and active, and equipment fingerprints. Treat them as personal
# data and share them only deliberately (see CONTRIBUTING.md).
data/
*.npz
*.joblib
*.cf32
*.cs8
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Site-specific configuration (copy config/local.example.yaml instead)
config/local.yaml

